// Eagles' Peak (28 November 2006). The npcs are rev 474's (474 npc 5120-5140), imported by
// tools/models/importnpc474.py; examines are the OSRS wiki's. Nickolaus is 474's 5126-5129, the eagles
// 5130-5133 (one model, 474's four sets of recolours), the kebbit 5137, Charlie 5138, the boulder 5140.
// The flying eagles over the peak are 474's 5120-5123, on 377's own giant eagle (npc_1821, the Bald
// Headed Eagle of My Arm's Big Adventure) and its flying animation.

// The zookeeper at Ardougne Zoo who starts the quest (474 npc 5138).
